{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/setmaximumambientcachesize:withcompletionhandler:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(im)setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:withCompletionHandler:"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets the maximum ambient cache size in bytes. The default maximum cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"size is 50 MB. To disable ambient caching, set the maximum ambient cache size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":". Setting the maximum ambient cache size does not impact the maximum size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of offline packs."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setMaximumAmbientCacheSize:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSUInteger","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"cacheSize"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withCompletionHandler:"},{"kind":"text","tex